{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 31, :comments ["מעיל האפוד — that is worn over the efod." "כליל תכלת — entirely tekhelet. And it appears to me: since it is visible beneath the efod and the breastpiece, which serve as a remembrance, and the tekhelet too, which resembles the firmament, is thus for a remembrance — as our Rabbis wrote regarding the tekhelet in tzitzit: that tekhelet resembles the sea, and the sea resembles the firmament, and the firmament resembles the Throne of Glory — therefore it is entirely tekhelet and not argaman and not tola'at shani."], :book :exodus, :voice :rashbam, :lang :en, :chapter 28, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:43:29.479913465Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}